<title>USA: San Leandro USD, Calif., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>San Leandro USD, Calif., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $15.500 million of San Leandro USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, 1997 Election, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.096 percent.</p>
</text>
